# Keep the Docker build context to source inputs only. Native and JavaScript
# build outputs are produced inside the image.
.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
# ...except the vendored dialog build, which is a committed input, not an
# output. `**/dist` above would drop it and the frozen install would then fail
# on a missing `file:` target — the same ordering trap as `.gitignore`.
!vendor/zeus-web-dialog/dist
!vendor/zeus-web-dialog/dist/**
**/temp
temp
target
crates/**/target
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
docs/.vitepress/dist
*.log
.DS_Store
